WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.280
going to the gym, being better, waking up early,

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.000
eating the right foods.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.200
It's because maybe it's your kids,

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.600
maybe it's your wife, maybe it's your job,

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.320
and it's all just stuffed in your brain.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:14.080
You don't have it compartmentalized and organized

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.800
in these nice shelves.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.120
So where am I gonna put discipline?

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.600
In that mind, if I can't find other,

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:23.840
you gotta be able to find all these different things

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:24.960
in your mind.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:28.300
Oh, I can put discipline right there.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.880
I can put consistency right there.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.460
I can put all these things right there in that spot.
